.TH "nvme_init_set_features_power_threshold" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_power_threshold" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_power_threshold \- Initialize passthru command for Power Threshold
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_power_threshold
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "bool ept "  ","
.BI "__u8 pmts "  ","
.BI "__u8 pts "  ","
.BI "__u16 ptv "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "ept" 12
Enable Power Threshold (EPT)
.IP "pmts" 12
Power Measurement Type Select (PMTS)
.IP "pts" 12
Power Threshold Scale (PTS)
.IP "ptv" 12
Power Threshold Value (PTV)
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_POWER_THRESH
